# performance: in ACTS, the black keys (0.8.13) F#4 G#4 A#4 C#5 are the pad, bells, bass and drums (a tap mutes, a hold solos; a tap while
# soloed clears the solos); D#4 the breakdown (the bass and drums out on the next bar; again: back after a fill bar);
# the Mixer page, its knobs the four levels
wait 300
tap HOME
tapkey 15
expect mutes 2
tapkey 15
expect mutes 0
key 20 down
wait 600
key 20 up
expect mutes 0x80
tapkey 13
expect mutes 0
# the breakdown: on the next bar (Pre-show: 86 bpm, a bar 2.8 s)
tapkey 10
expect bd 0
wait 3000
expect bd 1
wait 4000
expect bd 1
tapkey 10
wait 6500
expect bd 0
# the Mixer page (three to the right of Story: Perform, One-shots, then it; 0.8.1): the four levels
tap HOME
turn SELECT 3
expect view 2
spin K4 -10
expect par3 35
# (0.8.13) the drum solo: C#4, from the next bar the drums alone, busier; again: a fill, back
listen
tapkey 8
said DRUM SOLO NEXT BAR
wait 8000
tapkey 8
said DRUM SOLO COMING BACK
wait 8000
